+MINECRAFT-ORIGIN ASSET PROVENANCE
+The mc-assets package declares MIT for its library. Its upstream src/datapaths-builder.ts downloads Minecraft client versions, extracts client JARs, and copies textures, models and blockstates; src/copyOtherTextures.ts copies texture data into its distribution. This application bundles generated atlases/models and copies mc-assets entity textures. Its build also copies assets/mojangles.ttf and background images. These facts identify provenance; they do not establish that all game-origin assets share the library code license. No additional Mojang asset redistribution grant was found in the inspected package license.
+https://github.com/zardoy/mc-assets/blob/main/src/datapaths-builder.ts
